rooms, medical station, wellness and recovery rooms, industrial laundry and linen, housekeeping, maintenance workshop, mechanical plant, water treatment and building automation.", "interior": "Level −1: laundry, plant, electrical, water, workshop, stores, receiving and the secure crew tunnel. Level 1: Prow Entrance, reception, luggage, operations, security, medical, dining hall and kitchen, lounges, shop, central atrium and courtyard garden. Level 2: four cabin wings (240 cabins), fitness centre, theatre, gaming, wellness, communal kitchen, study rooms. Level 3: four cabin wings (240 cabins) and quiet lounges. Levels 4–5: four towers, each with 20 quarters per level (160 in total) and a lounge."}, {"id": "P2-20", "name": "Utility", "size_text": "656 × 820 ft (200 × 250 m)", "notes": "Substation, air, water", "status": "proposed", "kind": "utility", "size_m": [200, 250], "rect_km": [22.54, 22.74, -5.35, -5.1]}, {"id": "P2-21", "name": "Service Shaft 1", "size_text": "328 × 1,476 ft (100 × 450 m)", "notes": "Access to the 60 m service layer · bow shaft, beside Street 1", "status": "proposed", "kind": "utility", "size_m": [100, 450], "rect_km": [20.88, 20.98, -5.3, -4.85]}, {"id": "P2-23", "name": "Service Shaft 2", "size_text": "591 × 1,640 ft (180 × 500 m)", "notes": "Access to the 60 m service layer · stern shaft", "status": "proposed", "kind": "utility", "size_m": [180, 500], "rect_km": [22.78, 22.96, -5.35, -4.85]}, {"id": "P2-22", "name": "Bow Garden / Stern Garden", "size_text": "56 and 44 acres", "notes": "Forecourt parks", "status": "proposed", "kind": "bays", "bay_count": 2, "bay_names": ["Bow Garden", "Stern Garden"], "bays_km": [[21.04, 21.44, -5.42, -4.85], [21.56, 21.96, -5.3, -4.85]], "rect_km": [21.04, 21.96, -5.42, -4.85]}], "streets": [{"name": "Gate Concourse", "width_m": 30, "rect_km": [20.56, 21.12, -6.013, -5.983]}, {"name": "Apron yards", "width_m": 113, "rect_km": [20.56, 21.12, -5.983, -5.87]}, {"name": "Pickup lanes", "width_m": 60, "rect_km":